{
  "text": [
    "In Russia, about 0\u00b75% of the population is incarcerated.",
    "However, prisoners accounted for 27% of tuberculosis cases in 1995.",
    " Since then, Russia has focused on addressing tuberculosis in prisons, enforcing both mandatory screening and directly observed treatment.",
    " These policies have been credited with reducing the proportion of tuberculosis cases that were detected in prisons to 12% in 2004."
  ],
